Zip and unzip codesigning dossiers with Python's zipfile instead of
/usr/bin/zip and /usr/bin/unzip, which executor images may lack.

rules_apple builds the test bundle and test host dossiers whenever
disable_legacy_signing is enabled, as --config=remote does.

